{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In STICKER/BALL you fire <strong>balls</strong>. Hit dice with the balls to earn points, and ricochet back for even more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also unlock <strong>stickers</strong>. These come in many forms: spiders, poop, clown. Stickers can interact in strange ways. For example, poop attracts flies. Spiders make webs. Spider webs catch flies. More points for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a gauntlet of weird opponents, unlock cool new stickers, and stack crazy combos for lots and lots of points. Once you run out of balls it\u2019s game over :( But you can take what you learned and try again! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537690/extras/ed136a97aad2b8abb6cc7472a8b8290d.poster.avif?t=1772620754\" width=780 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537690/extras/ed136a97aad2b8abb6cc7472a8b8290d.webm?t=1772620754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537690/extras/ed136a97aad2b8abb6cc7472a8b8290d.mp4?t=1772620754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Unique Stickers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 Dastardly Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frogs can hijack spaceships</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"http